            "path": "run.cir",
            "text": "* 01 Low-pass | AC\n* 1. Ready to run. Change R or C on Canvas.\n* 2. Click Run.\n* 3. Open Plot for waveforms; expand Measurements when available.\n.temp 27\n.include \"circuit.spice\"\n.control\nset filetype=ascii\nset appendwrite\nsave v(in) v(out) i(v1)\n* AC is small-signal response, not an output-swing test.\nac dec 80 10 1Meg\nlet gain_db = db(v(out)/v(in))\nlet phase_deg = 180/PI*cph(v(out)/v(in))\nmeas ac gain_at_fc FIND gain_db AT=1591.549431\nwrite out.raw v(in) v(out) gain_db phase_deg\n.endc\n.end\n"
          },
          {
            "path": "experiment.json",
            "text": "{\n  \"version\": 2,\n  \"environment\": {\n    \"profileId\": \"sky130-core-continuous-ngspice46-v1\"\n  }\n}\n"
